    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103145" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερέτ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a humming, twanging</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορμίγγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.104
			</span></i> (alluding to <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				200
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.612
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.352
			</span></i> (both <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <i>chirruping</i> of cicadas, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., <i>a mere
				sound</i> or <i>twittering</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερετίσματα τὰ εἴδη</span> (the Platonic ideas) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				83a33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ συνήθη ταῦτα τ</span>. the
			ordinary <i>prattle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.Gaz.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πόημα οὐχ ὡς τ. καὶ κροῦμα νοοῦμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.</u>
					2p.228H.
				</span></i>
			</div>
